			<string>India's flag stays dimmed and says Holiday on NSE trading holidays. The built-in list covers 2026. For later years, or a holiday announced since, type the dates here as YYYY-MM-DD, separated by commas or spaces, for example 2027-01-26, 2027-03-22. In a year without any list the flag follows weekdays only.

